packages/agentmesh-integrations/langgrap.doc:
General-purpose trust router mapping verdict values to node names.

Example::

    graph.add_conditional_edges(
        "trust_check",
        trust_router({
            "pass": "execute",
            "fail": "quarantine",
            "review": "human_review",
        }),
    )

